{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08429","headline":"留别贾舍人至二首 一 · 李白","name":"留别贾舍人至二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大梁白云起，飘颻来南洲。\n裴回苍梧野，十见罗浮秋。\n鳌拚山海倾，四溟扬洪流。\n意欲托孤凤，从之摩天游。\n凤苦道路难，翱翔还崑丘。\n不肯衔我去，哀鸣慙不周。\n远客谢主人，明珠难暗投。\n拂拭倚天劒，西登岳阳楼。\n长啸万里风，扫清胷中忧。\n谁念刘越石，化爲绕指柔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08429.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08429","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}